'''Summon Spectral Tiger''' is a [[skill]] that summons an allied [[Monster:Metadata/Monsters/SummonedTiger/SummonedTiger|Spectral Tiger]] [[minion]] for a duration.

==Skill mechanics and interactions==
Spectral Tigers last for 30 seconds by default, use a melee {{sl|id=Melee}}, and scale with the player's modifiers to [[critical strike chance]] and critical strike multiplier with [[claw]]s. Generic sources of crit and crit multi do not apply. Spectral Tigers also inherently have the modifier {{c|mod|100% of Physical Attack Damage [[Leech]]ed as Life}}.

Each tiger also grants a stackable attack and cast speed and critical strike chance buff to the owner.

The maximum number of Spectral Tigers a player can have is 5. Triggering the skill while at the maximum number of Tigers will refresh an existing tiger's duration.

The skill has a [[cooldown]] of 0.5 seconds.

==Acquisition==
This skill can only be gained indirectly from [[Farrul Bloodline]]'s {{psl|Huntleader}}.

